[gd_resource type="Resource" script_class="CasChapterSceneVisual" load_steps=21 format=3]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://scripts/chapter_scene_resource.gd" id="1_scene"]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://scripts/chapter_line_resource.gd" id="2_line"]

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_0"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="档案箱离开水面时，锁扣已经酥了。拉姆森没有立刻撬开，她先把箱底的淤泥接到托盘里，从中捡出一截很细的红线。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_1"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="lamson"

speaker_name=""

text="封签有人重新缝过。原来的线是白的。你看，这边还有一段。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_2"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="会不会只是维修？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_3"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="lamson"

speaker_name=""

text="会。所以先拍下来，别急着给别人定罪。手套拿过来，纸一碰就散。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_4"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="箱子里没有你期待的姓名、照片或答案。只有几张维护表、一枚不再走的计时器，和一袋装得很仔细的净水膜。最不神秘的东西反而没有受潮。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_5"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="他们把吃水的东西包了三层，把秘密只包一层。真是会过日子的人。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_6"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="perkins"

speaker_name=""

text="最后两页被拆走了。不是烂掉，孔边切得很整齐。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_7"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="这里写着“拒绝同步”。后面为什么空了？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_8"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="你把那四个字念出来。无线电里原本的静噪声忽然变得很低，像有谁在隔壁按了一下琴键。弗莱彻伸手关了主扬声器，房间里只剩水从箱角滴下的声音。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_9"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="fletcher"

speaker_name=""

text="先别在开放频道读。旧金山知道这份东西从哪儿来的，我们当面问。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["fletcher", "drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_10"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="如果她就是不想让我们知道的人呢？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["fletcher", "drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_11"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="perkins"

speaker_name=""

text="那更要留下原件、照片和我们见过什么的记录。不是把整箱扔回水里，然后靠怀疑撑过明天。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["fletcher", "drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_12"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="你低头看计时器。表针停在一个没有意义的刻度，却让你想起有人从背后盖住过你的手。你不愿再去想那只手是为了阻止，还是为了帮忙。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["fletcher", "drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_13"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="你脸色不太好。我们先把净水膜送到仓库？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["fletcher", "drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_14"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="我想把档案也带着。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["fletcher", "drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_15"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="fletcher"

speaker_name=""

text="可以。箱子我提，记录你拿。中途要是想歇，直接说。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["fletcher", "drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_16"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="回码头的路上，德雷顿开始数新换的路灯。她数错了一次，你提醒她，她又从头数。你知道她不是不会数，只是想让你把目光从那截红线上移开。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["fletcher", "drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_17"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="给旧金山看之前，你想先告诉谁？这个回答我不会替你选。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["fletcher", "drayton", "perkins"])

